Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:34.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(圣经)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.13,0:02:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,核对下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just checking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.05,0:03:49.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No way in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.57,0:03:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,协议不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:54.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们发誓能干掉救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people swore you could take the Saviors out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:55.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:59.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们的协议结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So any arrangement we had is now done --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:01.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}null and void.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:05.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是贸易伙伴  不是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We aren't trade partners, we aren't friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从未见过面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:08.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:09.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:16.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不欠你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  你欠我的  因为我收留了难民\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, you owe me for taking in the refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:19.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我冒了很大的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}at great personal risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:21.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那时真勇敢  待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you were very brave staying in here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:23.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而玛姬和萨沙救了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}while Maggie and Sasha saved this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的勇气真是鼓舞人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your courage was inspiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.65,0:04:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是为我工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't you work for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:31.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里  我们已经开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory, we already started this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是你开始的  -是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You started it. - We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:34.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:35.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人是凶手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.86,0:04:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就想这样活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this how you want to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:39.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受他们的控制  他们还杀你们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under their thumb, killing your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我们无法选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-Sometimes we don't get to choose
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:43.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生活的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}what our life looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:43.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, Ricky,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得珍惜眼前的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to count the blessings you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能分出多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people can we spare?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有多少人可以战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people here can fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:52.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:56.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道我们有多少人  玛格丽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know how many people we have, Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:57.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And does it even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:04:58.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}...w-w-what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.35,0:05:03.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,组一队种高粱的农民吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start a platoon of sorghum farmers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.21,0:05:04.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们只有这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:07.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们种庄稼  不想战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They grow things. They're not gonna want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:10.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当人们有机会做正确的事时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When people have the chance to do the right thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一般会挺身而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}they usually step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.53,0:05:13.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-人们就  -你开始唱歌之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, people just -- - L-Let me stop you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先打断你一下  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you break into song, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.36,0:05:18.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:21.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁来给这些炮灰训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would train all this cannon fodder?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:22.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我来  -给我一周时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will. - Give me a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:25.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是反问  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhetorical, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:27.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:29.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不想听到关于此事的半个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never want to hear another word about any of it, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没了救世军  我们是不是过得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would we be better off without the Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:34.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是或不是  -是  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- yes or no? - Yeah. Sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:38.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你要怎么解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what will you do to fix the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没说我们有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say we had a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:40.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我管辖范围之外发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happens outside of my purview
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}is outside of my purview.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.14,0:05:46.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要么站我们这边  要么不站\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're either with us or you ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:49.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你坐在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sitting over there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:51.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见人说人话  见鬼说鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}talking out of both sides of your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我已经说得很清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- I think I've made my position very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:06:01.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想感谢你们所有人今天没有来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want to thank all of you for not being here today
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:04.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没跟我会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not having this meeting with me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:06.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去时也别让人看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or -- or being seen on your way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.17,0:06:11.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换种说法  从后门走\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other words, go out the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:23.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-胆小鬼  -真想打掉那蠢货的牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Walking ballsack. - Wanna knock that idiot's teeth out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:28.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我们也不需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we don't need him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:30.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.21,0:06:32.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们有玛姬  萨沙和耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we have Maggie and Sasha and Jesus here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:35.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:37.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-嗨  -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, um -- - What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:42.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:07:00.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不记得了  我是伯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you don't remember, I'm Bertie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:03.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们救了我两次命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I owe my life to you all, twice over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们许多人都被救过\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bunch of us do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:07.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德说你们想说服格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid says that you want Gregory
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.99,0:07:09.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们跟你们一起对抗救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get us to fight the Saviors with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:10.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.54,0:07:13.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是的  -你觉得我们能赢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. ?- Do you think we can win,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:15.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的能打败他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we really could beat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:16.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.85,0:07:18.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:24.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德说你们能训练我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Enid says you could show us the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:26.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我准备好了  -我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm ready. - Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.49,0:07:27.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Yeah. -Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:28.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-开始吧  -我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's do it. - I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是个开始  -我们会找到更多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a start. - We'll get more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:39.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还是不够  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It still won't be enough. - No, it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.55,0:07:41.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要找到合适的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we find the right stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.03,0:07:43.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许根本不需要以人数取胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}then maybe we don't need the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸飞他们  烧死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow 'em up, burn 'em to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过救世军里不仅有士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said there weren't just soldiers with the Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:50.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there were workers there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:51.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别无选择的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}People didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:53.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更多人手  另一个社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more hands, another group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:07:58.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根有前哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan has outposts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:08:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地形和距离都对我们不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}The geography, the distance works against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.13,0:08:04.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们来找达里尔  我们得在\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they come looking for Daryl, we need to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:06.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们没必要回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.87,0:08:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.51,0:08:12.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是他们的长距离对讲机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of theirs, long range.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.25,0:08:15.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以偷听  了解他们的动态\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can listen in, keep track of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们不回去  那我们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if we're not going back, what are we doing, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候让你们见以西结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time we introduced you to Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.01,0:08:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:25.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:56.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里叫神之国吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called "The Kingdom"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:08:58.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:00.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我取名的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:04.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much farther?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.49,0:09:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,严格说来  我们已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, technically, we're already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:09.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我们一直在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're always here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.35,0:09:13.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们到了  神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}but here we are -- at the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:16.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是它的外围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, its outer edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们等什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what the hell we waitin' on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.07,0:09:21.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何人胆敢擅闯神之国领土...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who dares to trespass on the sovereign land of the --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.61,0:09:35.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣  是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人是谁  保罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are all these people, Paul?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好呀  理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.93,0:09:47.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.89,0:09:50.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:52.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的这些朋友们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends, who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Rick Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:58.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是一个和我们志同道合的社区的首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the leader of a like-minded community.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:00.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是他的一部分人马\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are some of his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.44,0:10:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要晋见以西结国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would like to request an audience with King Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:15.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:21.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说他们是...志同道合的社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say they're a... like-minded community.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:23.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么个志同道合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like-minded how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们求生  做交易  和行尸战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live, we trade, we fight the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时也和别的东西战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:37.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,排好队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Line up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:39.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  这就是在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. This is a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:41.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:44.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王很繁忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King is a busy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:47.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这又是个危机四伏的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's a dangerous world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:50.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一般不会让一堆陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't usually allow a pack of strangers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随意迈进我们的大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}to waltz through our door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:54.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想让这个世界不那么危机四伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to make the world less dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:56.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是过来向国王表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are all here to show the King
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的严肃程度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how serious we are about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:01.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把车留在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car stays outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:03.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪支上缴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta hand over your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:04.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就两把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only have two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.83,0:11:15.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:28.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去之前我想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we go in,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.07,0:11:32.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有勇有谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have a brain and a backbone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:34.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我和你谈  而不是格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm talking to you, not Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:37.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论你这次来是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're trying to start here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:40.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了另一条庇护协议  或是交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}another protection pact, a trade,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:42.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这些都毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of it matters
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:44.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非我们着手处理真正的问题...\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we don't start dealing with the real problem --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:49.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理查德  我从来没见你笑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Richard, I've never seen you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:53.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点今天可能要改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's gonna change today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:17.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们人数是挺多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.55,0:12:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们能战斗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can they fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.41,0:12:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妥妥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:39.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.35,0:12:57.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是怎么认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变刚开始我们就认识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go back to the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王准备好接见你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the King is ready to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:13.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你找到卡萝尔了吗  -找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you find Carol? - I did, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她人呢  她没出事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she? Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:16.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她之前在这里  后来离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was here, and then she left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.35,0:13:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不满我跟着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, she wasn't too happy, me following her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她想远离我们  远离所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to get away from us, from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我找到她时  她中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I found her, she was shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是擦伤  我把她带回了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a graze. I got her back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.87,0:13:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有医生  挺厉害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got doctors. They're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.67,0:13:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他们干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:36.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她遇上了他们中的几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had crossed with some of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.87,0:13:40.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后其中一个跟着她  想要杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one of them followed her, tried to kill her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我阻止了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:47.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.59,0:13:51.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:56.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔之前在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她得到了帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:00.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今她离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:15.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:18.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你  老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It pleases me to see you, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:21.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他确实很高兴  -杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It pleases him, indeed! - Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:26.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给好以西结国王带来了什么消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}what news do you bring good King Ezekiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:28.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些你是给我带来的新盟友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these new allies you've brought me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实是的  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, they are, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.69,0:14:31.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:35.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我忘了和你们说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. I forgot to mention that --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:36.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  有只老虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:41.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Rick Grimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:43.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大的首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}the leader of Alexandria,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:44.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是他的一部分人马\N{\fnArial\fs30}and these are some of his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎各位来到神之国  旅人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I welcome you all to the Kingdom, good travelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:51.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为何来到我们这片美丽的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what brings you to our fair land?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:54.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为何求见本王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you seek an audience with the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:03.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结...国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King...Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.91,0:15:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexandria,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:09.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Hilltop,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:11.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神之国...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Kingdom --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:16.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这三个社区有一个共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}all three of our communities have something in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:20.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都侍奉救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all serve the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:24.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大曾和他们干过一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexandria already fought them once,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:25.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we won.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为自己解决了威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we took out the threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.72,0:15:29.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们那时没有摸清敌情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we don't know then what we know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:33.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是端掉了一个哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only beat one outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:35.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得知你和他们做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been told you have a deal with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:36.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.84,0:15:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你一定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是用暴力和恐惧进行统治的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they rule through violence and fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陛下  我只告诉了他们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I only told them of the --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:48.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人民并不知道我们和救世军的交易...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our deal with the Saviors is not known among my people --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:49.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这么做是有正当理由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for good cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:53.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你和我们说了山顶寨所受的苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made you a party to that secret
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们才向你透露了那个秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you told us of the Hilltop's own travails,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:56.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们没想到你会向别人泄密...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we did not expect you to share --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:15:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以互相帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准打断国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't interrupt the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们信任了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We brought you into our confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:06.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为何要破坏这份信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.14,0:16:09.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我想让你听听瑞克的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I want you to hear Rick's plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:14.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又有何计划呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what plans have you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.77,0:16:16.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大的瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick Grimes of Alexandria?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:20.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来此请求神之国  请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came to ask the Kingdom, to ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:23.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加入我们  一起反抗救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}to join us in fighting the Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:26.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为所有人的自由而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}fighting for freedom for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:30.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的请求很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you are asking is very serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.87,0:16:34.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有好几个人  他们都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several of our people -- good people...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:37.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被救世军残忍杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}were killed by the Saviors, brutally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:38.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.95,0:16:42.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:45.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞  奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer, Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:50.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金被劫走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.27,0:16:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也劫持过达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:53.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他逃了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:56.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要他没被抓回去  他就是个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every second he's out here, he's a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.11,0:17:01.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想说自己是对的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna say you were right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:02.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:04.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:08.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的死  我非常遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just real sorry they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:12.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根杀害了格伦和亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan murdered Glenn and Abraham,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活活砸死了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}beat them to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐吓山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrorized the Hilltop,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:19.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放出行尸  只为立威\N{\fnArial\fs30}set loose walkers just to make a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.94,0:17:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾以为我们能忍受他们的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to think the deal was something we could live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.89,0:17:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多人都这样以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of us did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但情况变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:30.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以让我们改变世界吧  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's change the world, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想坦白地说出我们的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be honest about what we're asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人都很强  但人手不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people are strong, but there's not enough of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.91,0:17:41.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没枪  至少不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have guns... not enough, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:44.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有足够的武器  就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a lot of weapons, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们联盟  先下手为强  就能打败他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we strike first, together, we can beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再等着事情发展到\N{\fnArial\fs30}no more waiting for things to get worse
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.45,0:18:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可收拾的地步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}beyond what we can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要扭转事态\N{\fnArial\fs30}We set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时机正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.77,0:18:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根  你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan, what say you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:25.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:28.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:32.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:36.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会死很多人  不仅是救世军  还有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people, and not just the Saviors. It...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:42.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能找到更好的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can find another way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.15,0:18:44.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:47.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许只是尼根的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's just about Negan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:50.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要抓住他  扣住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}just capturing him, holding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.14,0:18:50.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.03,0:18:56.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时候不早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hour grows late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大的瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick Grimes of Alexandria...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.59,0:19:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王要深思你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have given the King much to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.07,0:19:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我小时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when I was a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:10.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈给我讲过一个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}my mother told me a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.81,0:19:16.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从前有条通向王国的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a road to a kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路中间嵌着一块大石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there was a rock in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:22.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们只是绕着它走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people would just avoid it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而马匹会被绊到  伤到腿而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}but horses would break their legs on it and die,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:28.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马车轮子会脱落\N{\fnArial\fs30}wagon wheels would come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:31.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们损失了很多要卖的货物\N{\fnArial\fs30}People would lose the goods they'd be coming to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:35.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个小女孩就遇到了这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happened to a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:39.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她自家酿的啤酒桶掉了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cask of beer her family brewed fell right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:40.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摔坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:43.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒都渗进土里  没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dirt soaked it all up, and it was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是她家最后的指望\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was her family's last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.67,0:19:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们挨饿  没钱买吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were hungry. They didn't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:59.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她只能坐在那里哭  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just... sat there and cried, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不明白为什么石头还嵌在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}...she wondered why it was still there...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.77,0:20:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去伤害其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for it to hurt someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.07,0:20:13.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以她把石头挖了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she dug at that rock in the road
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:16.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用双手挖  直到血流不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}with her hands till they bled,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:19.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用尽一切方法把它挖了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}used everything she had to pull it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:21.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花了好几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:24.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:29.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当她准备填坑的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}...when she was gonna fill it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她看到坑里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}she saw something in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一袋金子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a bag of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.36,0:20:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是国王埋下的那块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king had put that rock in the road
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:47.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他知道  肯挖出它的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he knew the person who dug it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯动手的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who did something,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.15,0:20:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们值得受奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}they deserved a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们值得过上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They deserved to have their life
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:58.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更好的生活  直到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}changed for the good.... forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:10.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我邀请你们共进晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invite you all to sup with us
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.15,0:21:12.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并留宿到明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stay till the morrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we need to get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:19.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清晨我会降旨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall deliver my decree in the morn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.76,0:21:56.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:21:57.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.10,0:21:58.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were one of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.71,0:22:05.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不掉头跑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just run the other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.66,0:22:07.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我在训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm...I'm training.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:09.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逼迫自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pushing myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.65,0:22:12.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直面困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.43,0:22:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把保险上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the safety back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:17.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在练习射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practicing shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.55,0:22:21.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你点建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.33,0:22:23.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天快黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be dark soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.56,0:22:26.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别一个人溜达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wander around out here on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:27.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会没命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:30.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不该转悠  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same goes for you, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.20,0:22:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家吧  本杰明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home, Benjamin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:35.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那个  我  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I...Wha...  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.40,0:22:38.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结会时常来看望你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel's gonna keep coming out here to check on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.89,0:22:41.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不想打扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't want to bug you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.29,0:22:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他得知道你是否还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he needs to know that you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.89,0:22:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟你说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:47.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.32,0:22:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.30,0:22:52.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就告诉他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tell him...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.29,0:22:55.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对在意的人都会照料倍至\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks out for the people that he cares about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.86,0:22:58.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要吃的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.37,0:23:00.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者水\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bottle of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.65,0:23:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我多带了一些以防碰到有需要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I carry extra in case I run into someone who needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.56,0:23:06.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:09.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为人已经所剩不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a lot of us left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得互相帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have to help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.72,0:23:18.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许还会再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.83,0:23:23.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面脚步要轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heel-toe, heel-toe out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.70,0:23:25.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,膝盖弯着走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bend at your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.49,0:23:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得安静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.34,0:23:28.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老远就听到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you from a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:30.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.04,0:23:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待一切开始时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when this happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.06,0:23:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待自由之声响起时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when we allow freedom to ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.88,0:23:45.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,响彻每个村庄  每个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we let it ring from every village and every hamlet,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.28,0:23:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个州  每个城市时\N{\fnArial\fs30}from every state and every city,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.07,0:23:49.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将能加速那一天的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will be able to speed up that day
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.75,0:23:51.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时  上帝的所有子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}when all of God's children,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.77,0:23:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑人和白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}black men and white men,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.78,0:23:56.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犹太人和非犹太人  新教徒和天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jews and Gentiles, Protestants and Catholics,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.17,0:23:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能携手并进\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be able to join hands
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.55,0:24:01.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,合唱那首古老的黑人灵歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sing in the words of the old Negro spiritual --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.81,0:24:05.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于自由了  终于自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free at last, Free at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.18,0:24:07.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢全能的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God Almighty,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.64,0:24:11.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们...终于自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are...free at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.86,0:24:30.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你今天来帮我讲故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for stepping in on story duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.46,0:24:35.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来道晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped in to say good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.01,0:24:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没来吃晚餐  你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed supper. Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.39,0:24:41.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去林子里散了散步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went for a walk in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.90,0:24:43.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.47,0:24:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没人陪同吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unaccompanied? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.12,0:24:47.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来的路上干掉了两个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took out two dead ones on my way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.88,0:24:51.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棍子使得不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting pretty good with the stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.24,0:24:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想练练枪法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted to practice with the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.39,0:24:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到卡萝尔在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, saw Carol out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.34,0:25:04.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她看起来还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she, uh...seem well?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.11,0:25:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你跟她说话了吗  -说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did -- Did you talk to her? ?- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.89,0:25:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她问我为什么带着食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}She asked why I carry food and water
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.71,0:25:13.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防遇到别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case I run into people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.55,0:25:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you told her?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.19,0:25:19.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是为什么我们该答应瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same reason we should say yes to Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.48,0:25:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.59,0:25:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了他们的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.15,0:25:34.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有我们的帮助  他们都会搏上一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna risk everything if we help them or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.24,0:25:39.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们不帮他们  对他们置之不理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we don't help them, if we turn away,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.47,0:25:40.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就赢不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then they can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.74,0:25:44.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假设他们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they do, somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.26,0:25:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will have saved us,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.27,0:25:48.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么也不用干\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we won't have done a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.39,0:25:53.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad always said
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.50,0:25:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有人让你去逞英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if you're asked to be the hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.18,0:25:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就去逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.37,0:26:01.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我对一切都做好准备  我准备好了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me to be ready for anything, and I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.71,0:26:05.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.58,0:26:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you for your sage counsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.17,0:26:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲会非常骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father would be very proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.57,0:26:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王很骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King is very proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.41,0:27:08.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是这里的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.20,0:27:10.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.20,0:27:12.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这是有代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it came at a cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.48,0:27:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾想要更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanted more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.01,0:27:22.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾想要扩张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to expand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.48,0:27:25.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,建造更多像这里一样的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}To create more places like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.58,0:27:30.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们失去了四肢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men and women lost their limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.59,0:27:34.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们失去了双亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children lost their parents
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.97,0:27:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我在没必要的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I sent them into battle against the wasted
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.88,0:27:38.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派他们去与行尸作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I did not need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.20,0:27:39.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.81,0:27:40.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.97,0:27:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.27,0:27:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸不会支配掌控我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead don't rule us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.55,0:27:49.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面的世界跟墙内截然不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world doesn't look like this outside your walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.99,0:27:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们过得没这么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't have it as good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.14,0:27:53.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些人过得凄惨之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people don't have it good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.92,0:27:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能为我的子民考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to worry about my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.54,0:28:00.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你称自己为国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call yourself a damn king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.37,0:28:04.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却一点没有国王的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure as hell don't act like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.03,0:28:07.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.68,0:28:10.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都有代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}came at a cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.71,0:28:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是用生命  残肢断臂换来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was lives, arms, legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.46,0:28:28.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和救世军的和平并不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The peace we have with the Saviors is uneasy,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.69,0:28:29.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但起码是和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it is peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.91,0:28:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得把握住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to hold on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.19,0:28:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.47,0:28:40.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管神之国不能提供你们需要的协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although the Kingdom cannot grant you the aid you desire,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.81,0:28:43.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但国王同情你的困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King is sympathetic to your plight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.52,0:28:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以为友人达里尔提供庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offer our friend Daryl asylum
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.55,0:28:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想留多久都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}for as long as he requires it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.14,0:28:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在这里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.78,0:28:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军不会进入我们的围墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors do not set foot inside our walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.36,0:29:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这种情况能撑多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think that's gonna last?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.12,0:29:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew what was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.21,0:29:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道那个国王会拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that King guy would say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.89,0:29:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it still pissed me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.03,0:29:50.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我讲这个干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you telling me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.80,0:29:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们睡过同一个死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both had sex with the same dead guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.20,0:29:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不代表我们是朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make us friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.17,0:30:02.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能改变他的心意  但你不愿这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can change his mind, but you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.89,0:30:03.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你可以留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.12,0:30:06.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.76,0:30:11.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.02,0:30:13.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.13,0:30:15.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:16.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们连从正面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even have enough
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.70,0:30:19.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉哨站的人手都不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take on one outpost face-to-face yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.79,0:30:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以神之国必须加入进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the Kingdom has to get involved,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.53,0:30:25.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则救世军会一直掌管一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the Saviors will always be in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.57,0:30:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是士兵的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't about soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.33,0:30:31.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们使他们变得更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're making them stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.51,0:30:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他们的食物越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more food we give them,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.19,0:30:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,武器越多  或者任何东西更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more arms, the more everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.62,0:30:38.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天我们中有人给他上贡\N{\fnArial\fs30}every day any of us give them something,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.20,0:30:41.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就会变得越难被打败\N{\fnArial\fs30}they become harder and harder to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.10,0:30:44.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  开门  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, open it up. We're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.67,0:30:49.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.55,0:30:52.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.10,0:30:53.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是最聪明的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the smartest play.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.77,0:30:56.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心里清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:31:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试着跟以西结谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to talk to Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.28,0:31:03.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者一直盯着他直到他妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or stare him into submission --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.82,0:31:05.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管用什么方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.32,0:31:10.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.84,0:31:35.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,致所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}For anyone out there
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.73,0:31:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我一样爱那个肥鬼的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who loved the obese bastard as much as I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.03,0:31:40.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.09,0:31:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥乔不是最牛逼的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fat Joey was not the most badass son of bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.05,0:31:46.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他很忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.52,0:31:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a great sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.10,0:31:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上前两天我们还在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, we were just joking about oral sex
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.26,0:31:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和露西尔口交\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Lucille the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.77,0:31:56.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了一切都不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things will not be the same now that he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.29,0:31:57.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没了肥乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without Fat Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.18,0:32:02.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦乔就只是乔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skinny Joey is just Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.51,0:32:05.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈悲催\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's a goddamn tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.20,0:32:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们默哀片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's have a moment of silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.20,0:32:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人想挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's trying to block the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.34,0:32:14.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta be the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.53,0:32:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.39,0:32:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想那是他们的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's their base over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.40,0:32:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.47,0:32:24.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是想让别人难接近他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be trying to make it hard to get to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.51,0:32:25.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.45,0:32:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们移开车  然后再移回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll move them, and then we'll move them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.23,0:32:30.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会知道我们来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't need to know we were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.65,0:32:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.97,0:32:53.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.61,0:33:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.64,0:33:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.69,0:33:16.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在卡车后面藏着的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was hiding in the back of the truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.84,0:33:18.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到有几个人讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard a couple of them talking about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.54,0:33:20.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为尸群准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for a herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.84,0:33:22.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以用的是钢索\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why it's a steel cable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.61,0:33:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是为了一只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just for one walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.53,0:33:25.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.85,0:33:32.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要这些炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need these explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.54,0:33:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.97,0:33:36.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但首先我们得想办法拆除\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to figure out how to disarm it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.73,0:33:49.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.34,0:33:53.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这东西爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backing up is not gonna make a difference
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.96,0:33:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}if this thing goes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.83,0:34:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现红色事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got ourselves a red situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.54,0:34:05.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派一支搜索队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a search party.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.19,0:34:06.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看达里尔有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if Daryl ran home
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.50,0:34:08.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犯傻跑回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the dumb animal that he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.76,0:34:11.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就去办  午饭前赶到\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it. Be there in time for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.16,0:34:13.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那个小破地儿掘地三尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn that sleepy little burg upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.48,0:34:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.39,0:34:16.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得在他们之前回去  但我们需要这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get there before them, but we need these.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.75,0:34:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们得清出一条路  -是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to clear a path anyway. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.68,0:34:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.42,0:34:31.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一部分完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}First part's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.63,0:34:34.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在呢  我们得拆掉次级炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now? We gotta unwrap the secondary explosives --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.12,0:34:35.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸药  火箭筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dynamite, the RPGs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.65,0:34:37.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确保别装混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure these casings are not messed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.30,0:34:39.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不要乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do not mess them up, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.43,0:34:40.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西还能炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing could still blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.62,0:34:42.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都听到了  行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all heard her. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.14,0:35:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把完好的炸药装上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can load the explosives into the trunk as long as they're in good shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.57,0:35:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能有凹痕和撕裂  它们没激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}No dents, no tears. They're not live.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.85,0:35:43.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还需要被触发引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still need to be triggered to be set off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.62,0:35:46.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别拿这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.41,0:35:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-看样子不行  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't like the way it looks. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.10,0:35:56.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.12,0:35:58.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.47,0:36:03.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.54,0:36:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还远\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're far.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.72,0:36:08.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.79,0:36:10.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.71,0:36:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need these.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.82,0:36:20.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把车放回斜坡前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need to get the cars back in front of the onramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.95,0:36:23.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会知道我们拿了炸药  有什么用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll know we took their explosives, so does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.02,0:36:25.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们要让尸群留在公路上  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We want that herd to stay on the highway. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.06,0:36:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也许会用到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.20,0:36:30.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  塔拉  卡尔  快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Tara, Carl, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.51,0:37:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.20,0:37:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.38,0:37:16.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙  耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha, Jesus,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.01,0:37:19.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以走回山顶寨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you get back to the Hilltop on foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.28,0:37:20.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.30,0:37:21.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉玛姬我们不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Maggie we're not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.83,0:37:22.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.04,0:37:25.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.62,0:37:35.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要每一根炸药  火箭弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need every stick, every RPG.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.06,0:37:37.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.82,0:37:39.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.04,0:37:45.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们会堵死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna cut them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.41,0:37:47.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们分头走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just split up?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.87,0:37:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.67,0:37:49.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.72,0:37:51.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果开动的话...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they run...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.11,0:37:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们启动的时候鸣笛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lay on the horn when we start it --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.24,0:37:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我挥下手一起走  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring my arm down, and we go. ?Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.90,0:37:58.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.76,0:38:24.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-该死  -我们会想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn it! ?- We'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.42,0:40:08.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点也不喜欢那场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I didn't like the look of that shit at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.60,0:40:11.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我硬要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pushed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.04,0:40:13.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我硬要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pushed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.83,0:40:16.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.55,0:40:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.08,0:40:21.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.26,0:40:23.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.66,0:40:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.57,0:40:34.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是活下来的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the ones who live.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.04,0:40:47.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车扔了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.26,0:40:48.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.85,0:40:50.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你什么都没找到  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't find anything. ?- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.02,0:40:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们得让所有人准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we need to get everyone ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.26,0:40:54.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.10,0:41:42.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.36,0:41:46.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  再次你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...hello again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.61,0:41:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想着你们不会这么快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought it'd be longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.85,0:41:51.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我们来收贡品吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we're here for a tribute?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.32,0:41:53.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.99,0:41:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有别的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there another reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.96,0:42:00.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.12,0:42:02.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来找达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here for Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.04,0:42:04.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可尼根抓走了达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Negan took Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.04,0:42:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你儿子来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but... then your son showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.98,0:42:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔就失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl went missing --
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.92,0:42:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许这两件事有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}might those two things be connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.68,0:42:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.54,0:42:18.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在才知道他逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know he was gone till right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.01,0:42:22.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this should be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.73,0:42:25.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  每人找一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, everyone find a buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.70,0:42:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna have to follow us around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.78,0:42:30.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's here,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.87,0:42:34.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要确保让你们亲眼看他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}we really need you all to see him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.44,0:43:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.64,0:43:21.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,架子空空如也\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are some bare shelving units.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.55,0:43:23.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们办了烧烤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys have a barbecue or something
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.14,0:43:24.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没叫我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not invite us?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.47,0:43:28.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  太悲哀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, this is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.65,0:43:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你们没有藏东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you're not trying to hide stuff from us,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.78,0:43:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为通常那没好下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that generally doesn't go over very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.07,0:43:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们人很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.01,0:43:38.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找东西越来越难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's...getting harder to find stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.40,0:43:41.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们最近的重心是寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our focus lately has been on finding things
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.22,0:43:42.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Negan might want.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.68,0:43:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还在适应新体制\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still adjusting to the new system.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.91,0:43:47.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们今天会找到更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were gonna scavenge more today.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.87,0:43:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你愿意等  我们会带东西回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you just wait, we'll...bring something back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.35,0:43:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find more.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.91,0:43:55.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.58,0:43:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来收贡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here for a pick-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.53,0:43:58.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.41,0:44:00.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那天快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that day is coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.35,0:44:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们最好做该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you best do whatever you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.81,0:44:04.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dig deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.50,0:44:05.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加倍努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go the extra mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.63,0:44:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冒一下险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take some risks!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.94,0:44:09.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.97,0:44:13.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会感激的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we will appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.38,0:44:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你的合作  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for the cooperation, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.62,0:44:25.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉把这里搞乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies for leaving the place a bit of a mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.55,0:44:30.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们还有其他屁事要去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we got a litany of other shit to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.22,0:44:32.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do you, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.41,0:44:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tick-tock.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.30,0:44:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chop-chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.04,0:44:46.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! And, Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.42,0:44:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果达里尔真在这里出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Daryl does turn up here
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.47,0:44:52.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两天后  两个月后\N{\fnArial\fs30}two days from now, two months from now...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.66,0:44:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  两年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}hell, two years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.27,0:44:59.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要知道这事没有诉讼时效\N{\fnArial\fs30}just know there's no statute of limitations on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.46,0:45:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把斧子放在手边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep that hatchet handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.45,0:45:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他在你们这出现  你会用上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need it if he turns up with you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.45,0:45:11.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次可不会像你儿子那次一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it won't turn out the way it did for your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.68,0:45:29.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,储藏室怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the pantry?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.38,0:45:30.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.50,0:45:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈加百利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need to talk about Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.53,0:45:33.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.72,0:45:37.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们去找物资的那晚  他在值班\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was on watch the night you all went to scavenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.39,0:45:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和他本来应该早上换班\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was supposed to take over for him in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.46,0:45:41.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没在哨岗上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't at his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.91,0:45:44.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,储藏室被清空了  少了一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pantry was cleared out and a car was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.66,0:45:45.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人再看到过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's seen him since.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.87,0:45:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}That son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.71,0:45:51.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他偷东西跑掉了  -看起来是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He stole our shit and ran. - That's...what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.56,0:45:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不想相信  -我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I don't want to believe it. - I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.29,0:45:55.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加百利不是那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.89,0:45:57.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会那样对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't do that to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.56,0:45:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也以为他变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he changed, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.91,0:46:00.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没有其他可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it can't be anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.15,0:46:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it can.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.75,0:46:09.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信他会带走我们的东西跑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe he would just take our stuff and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.20,0:46:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's -- that's not who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.02,0:46:17.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他看到奥利维亚和斯宾塞死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he saw Olivia and Spencer die
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.94,0:46:19.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在他面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}right in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.30,0:46:22.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.79,0:46:26.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他找到了勇气  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found his courage, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.32,0:46:29.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真心希望他能坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to believe he held on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.88,0:46:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么不带走这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't he have taken this with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.90,0:46:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么丢在地板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he leave it on the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.44,0:46:39.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面没有之前的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There weren't tracks out there before.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.43,0:46:41.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't find anything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.59,0:46:44.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许达里尔能发现些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Daryl could've picked something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.61,0:46:46.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.39,0:46:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没留纸条\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't leave a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.96,0:46:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然不想被找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He obviously doesn't want to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.10,0:46:55.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.81,0:46:59.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(船)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.14,0:47:05.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么知道我们去过那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would he know we were out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.92,0:47:09.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.04,0:47:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.19,0:47:17.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于要离开我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're finally leaving me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.98,0:47:19.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被你发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You caught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.13,0:47:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.74,0:47:26.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厌倦了在家里的快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}sick of being so damn happy at home, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.08,0:47:28.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道该怎么跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't know how to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.70,0:47:30.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe --
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.98,0:47:32.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.40,0:47:34.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加百利需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.87,0:47:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我问你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I ask you something,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.60,0:47:41.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能说实话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you tell me the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.49,0:47:45.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当然  -他们不是出去找物资的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - The others didn't go out there scavenging, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.29,0:47:49.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们又要抗击了  而他们没告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going after them again, and they're not telling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.93,0:47:51.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克有他的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick has his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.25,0:47:53.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克没有被毒打过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick didn't get the shit beaten out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.57,0:47:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为这只是去找加百利  但会有更多的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is about Gabriel, but it's gonna be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.02,0:47:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会有更多的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.15,0:48:03.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以拜托了  别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, please, please don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.61,0:48:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加百利是我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.38,0:48:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.14,0:48:16.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军的事  与此无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with the Saviors, that isn't this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.29,0:48:19.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果瑞克要对抗救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Rick is taking on the Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.96,0:48:21.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一切都有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.53,0:48:24.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们不在的时候他们发现了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-What if they find out while you're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.49,0:48:25.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们回来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they come back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.53,0:48:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.07,0:48:30.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背弃他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just turn our backs?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.54,0:48:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要我们活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.04,0:48:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个人都活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.48,0:51:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,